WEBVTT

00:02.960 --> 00:04.710
Thought Unison!

00:10.580 --> 00:12.500
I'll concentrate it and send it flying!

00:20.630 --> 00:22.790
Shatter him!

00:23.500 --> 00:24.960
Target!

00:24.960 --> 00:27.420
Taratectra!

00:27.420 --> 00:29.880
Look out, Tara dear!

00:29.880 --> 00:32.830
And scatter his pieces!

00:50.080 --> 00:56.130
We're not giving in!

01:15.540 --> 01:17.000
Take this.

01:51.540 --> 01:53.420
Even the meaning of life

01:53.420 --> 01:55.580
Was all taken away

01:55.580 --> 01:57.790
I was aiming to destroy

01:57.790 --> 02:00.580
This whole distorted world

02:00.580 --> 02:02.670
(In exchange for everything)

02:02.670 --> 02:04.830
I longed for power

02:04.830 --> 02:06.960
(Not caring about consequences)

02:06.960 --> 02:09.960
That waited at the end of the road

02:10.380 --> 02:14.420
Unleash yourself

02:14.420 --> 02:17.460
To change the future

02:17.460 --> 02:19.580
No one else will ever

02:19.580 --> 02:21.710
Have the answers

02:21.710 --> 02:23.540
So, I'm on my own

02:23.540 --> 02:25.880
To conquer my own path

02:26.170 --> 02:28.210
I've been fighting back

02:28.210 --> 02:30.460
In search of

02:30.460 --> 02:34.210
Not hope, not a miracle

02:34.210 --> 02:36.210
All I want is just the true meaning

02:36.210 --> 02:41.790
Of being with you

02:59.460 --> 03:01.880
I can't move...

02:59.460 --> 03:05.290
<b>Episode 17: My Comrade</b>

03:03.170 --> 03:05.000
What the hell happened?

03:07.540 --> 03:11.290
Why are you way over there?

03:12.960 --> 03:16.170
And why am I lying over here?

03:17.460 --> 03:20.000
I decided to run away
and survive another day.

03:20.420 --> 03:24.000
But I can't even run away
without another person's help.

03:25.170 --> 03:27.460
Why am I so weak?

03:28.210 --> 03:29.630
Damn it!

03:30.540 --> 03:31.920
So far away...

03:32.920 --> 03:34.920
I can't feel my limbs.

03:35.330 --> 03:37.540
Where am I right now?

03:38.290 --> 03:40.130
I can't see a thing.

03:40.330 --> 03:44.540
But if there's a chance to hunt dragons,

03:44.920 --> 03:48.540
then staying here is out of the question!

03:55.830 --> 03:57.580
Hunting Flash!

04:17.420 --> 04:18.630
Impossible.

04:20.960 --> 04:22.960
Purun!

04:23.250 --> 04:25.540
You shlayed the Erupshion Dragon!

04:25.540 --> 04:27.670
That wash shome fine work, shtupid human!

04:28.670 --> 04:34.670
The moment that silverine engulfed
Taratectra, he blew himself up!

04:35.750 --> 04:40.580
Take me somewhere that
smells like Taratectra!

04:40.580 --> 04:41.750
Puru?

04:42.580 --> 04:44.420
Impossible. Just impossible.

04:44.830 --> 04:46.710
There's no way! Tara, darling!

04:46.710 --> 04:49.000
C'mon, Tara, dear, say something!

04:49.000 --> 04:51.630
Answer me! Please!

04:51.630 --> 04:52.960
My comrade.

04:53.920 --> 04:56.250
My dearest Tara, you're okay!

04:58.170 --> 05:00.500
Thank goodness!

05:00.500 --> 05:02.460
Calm yourself and listen.

05:02.750 --> 05:05.420
I will die soon.

05:06.920 --> 05:07.880
Huh?

05:07.880 --> 05:12.210
I avoided dying instantaneously
by blowing myself up.

05:12.210 --> 05:14.250
But that is all.

05:15.170 --> 05:19.790
I am not so indestructible that I can
heal the wounds I've sustained.

05:20.420 --> 05:23.960
I swore an oath to fulfill my duty
without dying,

05:23.960 --> 05:26.460
and yet I'm in this pathetic state.

05:27.580 --> 05:31.250
There are no adequate words to express
my remorse to our progenitor.

05:31.250 --> 05:32.750
No!

05:33.330 --> 05:37.250
No, no, no, no, no, no!

05:37.500 --> 05:38.880
This isn't your fault!

05:38.880 --> 05:40.540
It's my fault!

05:40.540 --> 05:43.630
Because I lied to you!

05:43.630 --> 05:45.710
This is all because of my actions!

05:45.710 --> 05:49.000
But why are you suffering the consequences?

05:49.460 --> 05:54.130
Who is to blame is neither here nor there.

05:54.790 --> 05:57.500
What's important now is how we can prevail.

05:58.830 --> 06:01.210
It is not your fault.

06:02.790 --> 06:08.460
I loved Princess Lakucia
as a warrior loves his liege.

06:09.750 --> 06:11.500
But you...

06:12.790 --> 06:17.290
You loved Lakucia as a man loves a woman.

06:20.830 --> 06:25.830
I called you my comrade,
but I didn't let you into my heart.

06:27.540 --> 06:32.460
These consequences must be
due to my insincerity.

06:33.420 --> 06:40.710
I can think of only one way
for us to fulfill our duty.

06:41.750 --> 06:43.750
What are your thoughts?

06:45.250 --> 06:48.080
But nonetheless, I hope you forgive me.

06:49.210 --> 06:52.540
If I can no longer call you my comrade,

06:52.540 --> 06:56.040
I do not know what I should call you.

06:57.170 --> 07:00.830
You are our commander in this battle.

07:00.830 --> 07:02.460
Make a decision!

07:15.250 --> 07:18.080
Blow yourself up, Taratectra.

07:18.630 --> 07:23.170
Sacrifice your life to take all the
progenitor's enemies down with you.

07:24.170 --> 07:26.000
Understood.

07:26.000 --> 07:28.170
Farewell, my comrade!

07:29.000 --> 07:30.670
I am sorry.

07:37.630 --> 07:41.460
As a member of the bloodline,
I possess no talent.

07:41.460 --> 07:48.040
However, if I expend the entirety of
my being in one moment...

08:18.000 --> 08:19.920
What's that light?

08:19.920 --> 08:22.380
Taratectra exploded

08:22.380 --> 08:24.460
and Ragna is containing the blast.

08:25.540 --> 08:29.290
If Ragna succumbs, this whole area
will blow up with him.

08:29.290 --> 08:30.960
There is no escaping this.

08:43.920 --> 08:46.330
Shtand firm, shtupid human!

08:46.330 --> 08:51.170
If you shuccumb, I'll be roashted shlime!

08:51.750 --> 08:54.540
Pururururururu!

08:55.000 --> 08:58.380
I can't... freeze it!

08:59.210 --> 09:01.920
I can still muster up more power!

09:01.920 --> 09:02.920
But...

09:08.630 --> 09:12.960
Does not even Ragna have
enough power to quell this?

09:13.670 --> 09:17.670
No... It feels as if he's keeping
some of his power in reserve.

09:17.670 --> 09:18.750
Why?

09:19.000 --> 09:19.830
Wait!

09:19.830 --> 09:22.080
This is my sword's fault!

09:22.080 --> 09:25.130
Dammit! Dammit! Dammit!

09:25.420 --> 09:27.330
Commander!

09:27.830 --> 09:30.500
Could this day get any worse?

09:30.500 --> 09:35.290
Is there no end to the depths
of my foolishness?

09:37.920 --> 09:40.750
When I decided to fight on the surface,

09:40.750 --> 09:44.880
I had two hundred soldiers following me.

09:46.210 --> 09:49.920
One by one, they have perished.

09:51.170 --> 09:53.960
Only a few are still alive now.

09:55.830 --> 09:59.170
Everyone sacrificed themselves
and died fulfilling my orders.

10:00.040 --> 10:02.630
We've been utterly beaten down
by despair countless times.

10:11.040 --> 10:14.710
I just want to curl up into a ball and cry.

10:15.540 --> 10:16.750
Yet...

10:17.330 --> 10:19.210
And yet,

10:19.210 --> 10:22.710
despite all this,

10:23.420 --> 10:25.630
it's not like me to leave my fate

10:25.630 --> 10:29.460
in the hands of another person,
even the man I love.

10:30.080 --> 10:31.880
I will go forth and prevail!

10:31.880 --> 10:33.880
Take care while I'm gone!

10:36.000 --> 10:37.000
I...

10:38.500 --> 10:40.080
I won't...

10:41.080 --> 10:42.210
give up!

10:43.040 --> 10:44.380
I won't give up!

10:44.380 --> 10:45.710
I'm here for you!

10:46.130 --> 10:49.130
My troops will support me!

10:49.750 --> 10:51.500
We won't give up!

10:52.500 --> 10:55.500
Give every ounce of your strength!

11:08.750 --> 11:09.880
Is Her Highness safe?

11:10.170 --> 11:12.210
Can it, you bald four-eyes!

11:12.210 --> 11:15.790
I lost my glasses, and I'm not even bald!

11:16.000 --> 11:17.500
Greya! To the right!

11:23.710 --> 11:25.250
Just a little more...

11:25.880 --> 11:28.040
Just a little more,
and we're back in business!

11:29.750 --> 11:31.380
Enhanced durability!

11:31.380 --> 11:33.500
Stronger! Stronger!

11:35.670 --> 11:39.290
Instantly, something was imparted
to me from the princess's hand.

11:39.830 --> 11:43.710
So many people are living, fighting, dying...

11:44.250 --> 11:46.290
All so we could reach this moment!

11:46.670 --> 11:48.500
Something warm was imparted to me!

12:12.880 --> 12:14.000
Impossible!

12:14.420 --> 12:19.130
The energy from the blast has concentrated
and is now directed only on us!

12:20.330 --> 12:22.420
He has such tenacity!

12:22.420 --> 12:25.540
Even while dying, he refuses
to give in just like that!

12:25.540 --> 12:27.380
But that's only natural.

12:27.710 --> 12:30.710
He honorably sacrificed his life
for this attack.

12:31.380 --> 12:32.420
Don't worry.

12:33.580 --> 12:35.500
We're not losing after we've come so far.

12:39.420 --> 12:42.080
Within me, there is a sword.

12:45.790 --> 12:47.790
I want you to help me...

12:49.040 --> 12:51.290
And I'd like to repay you
with all my power!

13:04.540 --> 13:06.210
Silverine Battle Arts!

13:07.380 --> 13:08.880
Activate aura!

13:09.420 --> 13:10.920
Activate silverine!

13:11.630 --> 13:14.130
Shape silverine form!

13:14.750 --> 13:17.170
Hunting dragonkind all on my own
until they're no more.

13:17.170 --> 13:18.790
That's optimal.

13:19.710 --> 13:22.380
Form restored!

13:24.130 --> 13:27.170
Failure to do so would show I'm weak.
Dependent on others.

13:27.170 --> 13:29.170
That's what I've always thought.

13:29.170 --> 13:33.080
But now my heart is ablaze!

14:11.250 --> 14:12.790
Are you crying?

14:13.040 --> 14:14.630
I'm not crying!

14:14.630 --> 14:16.420
I'm livid!

14:16.420 --> 14:19.250
That's why you're so powerful?

14:20.250 --> 14:22.130
Because of your future self?

14:22.880 --> 14:24.080
That's absurd!

14:24.080 --> 14:27.790
How can someone so beautiful
end up all alone

14:27.790 --> 14:31.460
with no just recompense
and none of their wishes fulfilled...

14:32.830 --> 14:35.170
That is unacceptable to me!

14:40.250 --> 14:41.500
Thank you.

14:42.540 --> 14:44.040
Why are you thanking me?

14:44.380 --> 14:49.790
I'm glad and grateful that you
know my future self.

14:50.130 --> 14:51.710
If anything,

14:51.710 --> 14:55.040
I'm the one who should be thanking you!

14:55.040 --> 14:59.210
Without your help, we wouldn't have
had any chance of victory!

14:59.540 --> 15:03.540
As the commander of the corps,
I thank you from the bottom of my heart!

15:03.960 --> 15:08.790
A-and your last strike was,
like, super cool!

15:11.380 --> 15:14.710
Oh crap, I lost my cool and
totally word-vomited.

15:15.040 --> 15:18.000
Then I'll let this momentum
propel me further!

15:20.500 --> 15:21.830
Ragna!

15:21.830 --> 15:25.750
Part ways with that filth
and be with me from now on!

15:26.210 --> 15:29.500
I will not allow such a
wretched future to befall you!

15:30.830 --> 15:32.630
Give it some thought!

15:32.630 --> 15:35.250
And I shall not accept any answer but "yes."

15:35.960 --> 15:38.830
Well then, we'll meet again
after the teleportation!

15:39.880 --> 15:43.290
She's such a... dazzling person.

15:44.130 --> 15:45.540
Thank you.

15:45.710 --> 15:48.130
For surviving with me.

15:49.330 --> 15:52.790
We saved... each other.

15:55.210 --> 15:56.460
Commander!

15:57.830 --> 15:59.130
Your Highness!

15:59.130 --> 16:00.080
Thank goodness!

16:00.080 --> 16:03.460
We were crazy worried, Commander.

16:07.170 --> 16:08.710
It's over.

16:09.210 --> 16:10.920
Master Fu!

16:11.170 --> 16:14.670
The magic circle's reconstruction
is now complete!

16:16.080 --> 16:17.880
Teleportation circle...

16:17.880 --> 16:18.960
Activate!

16:19.250 --> 16:20.790
Hey, shtupid human!

16:20.790 --> 16:23.750
Shinshe you were victorioush
thanksh to my help,

16:23.750 --> 16:25.710
you shall be grateful to me
for ash long ash you live!

16:25.710 --> 16:27.210
Yes, I will.

16:27.710 --> 16:29.920
Mister Slime, you were fantastic out there.

16:29.920 --> 16:34.380
Purun! Purun! Mashter Crimshon
will shower me in praishe!

16:34.630 --> 16:35.500
Pu?

16:35.500 --> 16:38.040
Why ish your body glowing?

16:38.040 --> 16:39.500
Are you shick?

16:39.500 --> 16:42.080
This is the teleportation magic's light.

16:42.080 --> 16:43.710
That's great...

16:43.710 --> 16:45.250
It worked.

16:45.460 --> 16:48.460
Huh? Why ishn't my body glowing?

16:48.460 --> 16:50.420
Am I jusht getting ditched?

17:16.080 --> 17:17.540
How many more seconds?

17:23.290 --> 17:25.290
Whatever, let's fight!

17:28.330 --> 17:32.830
You gonna quit throwing a tantrum
and get serious, slow ass?

17:34.750 --> 17:36.790
Or have you already reached your limit?

17:36.790 --> 17:39.380
You already blew all your fighting power?

17:39.380 --> 17:40.750
Pathetic.

17:41.040 --> 17:42.790
Once you've surpassed your limits,

17:42.790 --> 17:46.670
your true value is whatever's left
that you can squeeze out of yourself.

17:47.420 --> 17:49.540
I'm the end of the line!

17:49.540 --> 17:52.960
Muster up everything you've got left
for the last fight of your life!

17:57.630 --> 17:58.920
Lady Ultimatia!

17:59.670 --> 18:01.500
Kamui just left!

18:02.250 --> 18:04.920
Yes. He's going to the battlefield.

18:05.710 --> 18:08.380
You need not worry, Nebulim.

18:09.580 --> 18:12.250
I am frightened by this enemy.

18:12.250 --> 18:16.040
The mere memories make me tremble.

18:17.080 --> 18:19.460
But everything will be fine.

18:21.080 --> 18:25.290
I cannot imagine for a second that fool

18:25.750 --> 18:29.000
losing to such a weak enemy.

18:30.460 --> 18:33.710
Followers of the Clawed Monarch
share no blood.

18:36.290 --> 18:39.250
Instead, their monarch teaches
those they favor combat arts.

18:39.250 --> 18:40.960
Regardless if they're dragon or human.

18:42.790 --> 18:46.000
Their monarch gives those who reach
a satisfactory proficiency

18:46.000 --> 18:48.500
one of their demonic swords.

18:48.750 --> 18:51.920
<b>Six Claws and Twin Fangs</b>

18:49.210 --> 18:51.040
The Six Claws and Twin Fangs.

18:52.130 --> 18:54.580
Six claws and one pair of fangs.

18:54.580 --> 18:57.420
The eight most powerful
demonic swords in the world.

18:57.830 --> 19:02.000
Those who possess one of these demonic
swords are called the Clawed Bloodline.

19:02.670 --> 19:06.830
They're powerful warriors tied together
not by blood, but by combat arts and swords.

19:06.830 --> 19:08.210
One such among them

19:09.040 --> 19:10.540
was killed.

19:11.460 --> 19:13.670
Their demonic sword was
stolen by an outlaw.

19:13.960 --> 19:16.710
That outlaw was Kamui
when he was still human.

19:17.670 --> 19:19.960
You shouldn't fight him.

19:19.960 --> 19:22.080
Something about him is off.

19:22.080 --> 19:24.540
He was an anomaly even when he was human.

19:25.040 --> 19:29.040
He's a genius of violence

19:29.040 --> 19:31.830
who can pull off elite feats of combat.

19:32.630 --> 19:34.830
He's not an enemy
you can beat with strategy.

19:34.830 --> 19:37.960
He's an enemy you use strategy
in order not to fight.

19:38.500 --> 19:40.880
If you must fight him,

19:40.880 --> 19:44.500
it must be after you've killed Ultimatia.

19:44.920 --> 19:46.750
Do you know why?

19:51.830 --> 19:54.670
I feel like Crimson said
something about this...

19:56.250 --> 19:57.540
But I forgot what.

21:16.130 --> 21:18.040
Lightning Claw Skyrend!

21:24.040 --> 21:26.170
Move. Move.

21:26.170 --> 21:27.500
Move!

21:31.420 --> 21:33.040
That all you got?

21:35.080 --> 21:37.000
How boring.

21:37.580 --> 21:44.250
Move. Move. Move. Move. Move.
Move. Move. Move. Move!

21:47.380 --> 21:48.880
Ragna!

21:48.880 --> 21:50.250
Wake up!

21:50.250 --> 21:51.580
Ragna!

21:52.880 --> 21:55.540
Ragna! Ragna!

21:58.580 --> 22:01.080
Wake up, Ragna!

22:03.130 --> 22:04.130
S...

22:05.330 --> 22:06.920
Silverware Princess?

22:25.960 --> 22:33.000
Although I know hiding my true self
beneath my wings is a futile endeavor

22:33.000 --> 22:39.710
Bearing the pain born of loneliness inevitably
gives way to an uneasy future, but also hope

22:39.710 --> 22:43.500
Battles in the sky turn adoration into vapor,
but constantly suppressing desire

22:43.500 --> 22:46.790
Will only ever bear twisted shapes

22:46.790 --> 22:53.750
How selfish of me, to want to make the rays of
the sun as daylight breaks in the east my own

22:53.750 --> 22:57.880
How can I explain that I want to believe

22:57.880 --> 23:06.210
In those dark yet brilliant places,
where vague words can't reach?

23:06.880 --> 23:11.380
Even if the heat burning my body
makes me want to let go

23:11.380 --> 23:15.500
Of the breath caressing my skin

23:15.500 --> 23:22.080
The wings that can carry me back to
that town matter to me a little more

23:22.080 --> 23:29.580
Ahh, if only I could keep going like this forever,
I would find a warm spot

23:29.580 --> 23:34.290
Still too soft to the touch
